    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "7,\nOZARK\nAIRLINES\nEMERGENCY\nTIMETABLE\nOZARK\n...\nNOTICE\nIn the event that the Federal Aviation Administration\n(FAA) institutes its Contigency Plan in response to a\nPATCO work action, Ozark will only be able to operate\ncertain flights at times designated by the FAA.\nThis Timetable shows flights as authorized by the FAA.\nTimes are approximate and are subject to change.\nFlights may be cancelled without notice.\nThe schedules shown in this Timetable will become\neffective ONLY in the event that the FAA Contingency\nPlan is put into effect, and will remain in effect only\nso long as the FAA designates."
